msgstr "<b>Por repasar:</b> {topics}"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “<b>7 erros</b> foram para o seu caderno de erros”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/exam-section.tsx
msgctxt "Qfdzfp"
msgid "<b>{count, plural, one {# mistake} other {# mistakes}}</b> went to your mistakes notebook"
msgstr "Guardamos <b>{count, plural, one {# error} other {# errores}}</b> en tu cuaderno de errores"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/exam-section.tsx
msgctxt "mM0WGu"
msgid "The score is only an estimate, made from your answers. Mock exams are available with Plus."
msgstr "El puntaje es solo una estimación basada en tus respuestas. Los simulacros están disponibles con Plus."

#. A section label for goals like school-leaving, entrance and civil service exams. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Provas e concursos”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/exam-section.tsx
msgctxt "Fvi-xC"
msgid "Tests and exams"
msgstr "Pruebas y exámenes"

#. {exams} lists the exams people in your country study for, such as “Enem, vestibular, concurso ou OAB”, and opens the sentence. In Brazilian Portuguese: “{exams}: o plano segue as matérias e os tópicos da sua prova. Na reta final, simulados no formato e no tempo da prova real mostram uma estimativa da sua pontuação e o que ainda falta.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/exam-section.tsx
msgctxt "V41OCV"
msgid "{exams}: your plan follows your exam's subjects and topics. In the final stretch, mock exams in the real exam's format and time show an estimate of your score and what's still missing."
msgstr "{exams}: tu plan sigue las materias y los temas de tu examen. En la recta final, los simulacros con el formato y la duración del examen real te muestran una estimación de tu puntaje y lo que aún falta."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Tudo o que cai, dividido até o dia da prova.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/exam-section.tsx
msgctxt "oFuFjH"
msgid "Everything on the exam, split up until exam day."
msgstr "Todo el temario, distribuido hasta el día del examen."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/example-card.tsx
msgctxt "xrCRnH"
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Ejemplo"

